# Private real-voice evaluation data. Recorded by Tejas on his own machine
# with his own microphone. Audio of a real person and the transcripts of what
# he said are personal data: they never enter version control, and no accuracy
# claim in this repository may quote a number that cannot be reproduced from
# the public synthetic corpus in tests/audio.
eval/private/
eval/private/**
*.wav.meta
corpus.jsonl
corpus_*.jsonl
eval_results/
eval/results/
*.eval.json

# Model weights. Downloaded on demand, never tracked.
models/
*.bin
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.ct2

# Phase 4 local state. corrections.json holds the words Tejas taught the tool
# and recovery.jsonl holds raw and final dictation text. Section 19 lists both
# as local-only, and calls this file an acceptance requirement rather than
# documentation advice.
corrections.json
corrections.json.*
recovery.jsonl
recovery.jsonl.*
